UID:10095189-1789268400-1789354799@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING SEPTEMBER 23rd | Morgan Wade w/ Susto
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, September 23 | 6:30 PM – 10:00 PM | Amphitheater Stage | From $36.92 Event Details and Tickets \nCountry singer-songwriter Morgan Wade has built a growing fan base through her raw lyrics\, distinctive voice\, and deeply personal music. In recent years\, she has also made headlines for her high-profile friendships\, fitness journey\, and candid discussions about her personal life. \nRather than smoothing over life’s rough edges\, Morgan Wade leans directly into them. Never one to mince words or play coy\, the celebrated singer-songwriter has built her career around undeniable honesty and vulnerable storytelling\, turning life’s hardest moments into songs that feel both deeply personal and universally understood. With a voice that carries equal parts grit\, vulnerability\, and strength\, Wade has emerged as one of the most compelling storytellers in contemporary country and roots music. \n  \nJustin Osborne has been performing as ‘Susto’ since 2013\, when he formed a collective of fellow musicians and artists in coastal Charleston\, South Carolina. Now a bona fide emissary of alt rock and treasure to the indie crowd\, a lifelong calling coupled with a cosmic push of serendipitous happenstance led to his latest venture: ‘Susto Stringband’ joined by Americana vocalist Clint Roberts\, mandolinist Jackson Grimm\, clawhammer banjoist Helena Rose\, and upright bassist Joey Brown (now Holler Choir). \nSierra Nevada Brewing Co. is one of America’s premier craft breweries\, highly regarded for using only the finest quality ingredients.  Sierra Nevada has set the standard for craft brewers worldwide with innovations in the brewhouse as well as advances in sustainability. The view from our tree-lined brewery is something special no matter the season. Tour the brewhouse\, feast in the Taproom or soak in the sun on our Back Porch with a beer\, including the legendary Pale Ale and a snack. For our upcoming event line-up click here! \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-september-23rd-morgan-wade-w-susto/2026-09-13/
LOCATION:Sierra Nevada Mills River\, 100 Sierra Nevada Way\, Mills River\, NC\, 28732
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Mills River
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/731195903_1349436207282644_2606036468582546619_n-e1786641057773.jpg
GEO:35.4308568;-82.5535594
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Sierra Nevada Mills River 100 Sierra Nevada Way Mills River NC 28732;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=100 Sierra Nevada Way:geo:-82.5535594,35.4308568
END:VEVENT
