SUMMARY:2026 Goombay
DESCRIPTION:Goombay Festival returns to Asheville’s historic East End for a vibrant celebration of Black culture\, music\, food\, art\, and community! Rooted in the rich traditions of Asheville’s Black community\, Goombay brings neighbors and visitors together for a weekend of unforgettable experiences—from live music and Go-Go to local vendors\, art\, dance\, food\, family activities\, and the Ujima 5K.\nPresented by the YMI Cultural Center\, Goombay is more than a festival—it is a celebration of heritage\, resilience\, creativity\, and the people who continue to shape Western North Carolina. Come experience the energy\, support Black-owned businesses and artists\, reconnect with community\, and celebrate the legacy of Asheville’s historic East End.\nCome for the culture. Stay for the community. Leave with the Goombay spirit.  ymiculturalcenter.org/goombay
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/2026-goombay-2/
LOCATION:YMI Cultural Center/Pack Square Park
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/742045780_1510038844499378_6021062072404927616_n-e1789056732238.png
END:VEVENT
